{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2023-05-24 09:00:00', 'title': 'DUPONT TO LAUNCH TEDLAR® FRONTSHEET SOLUTION AT 2023 SNEC PV POWER EXPO', 'text': 'SHANGHAI , MAY 24, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUPONT (NYSE: DD) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL INTRODUCE ITS LATEST TEDLAR®\xa0FRONTSHEET MATERIALS AT THE 2023 SNEC INTERNATIONAL PHOTOVOLTAIC POWER GENERATION AND SMART ENERGY EXHIBITION. DUPONT WILL BE LOCATED AT BOOTH W4-555 AT SHANGHAI NEW INTERNATIONAL EXPO CENTER.'}